  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4 Doors models\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: YITAMOTOR two raised steps running boards are compatible with the 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Jeep Gladiator JT 4 Doors models. Matching manufacturer-set mounting points for a secure, no-drill installation and reliable performance\nConvenient Use: ①These side step bars feature an extended length and a dual-convex platform design to help you reach the roof, bed, and cab with ease; ②Two-stair layout provides enhanced convenience for vehicles equipped with lift kits and oversized tires, while ensuring easy access for users of all ages\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel: The step rails are made from thick, heavy duty steel pipes with a weight capacity of 550 lbs; The durable powder coating grants your vehicle side protection against dirt, water, and rust\nNon-Slip Design: The hollow design prevents water and sediment accumulation, keeping the nerf bars dry and clean; This feature enhances safety and durability by reducing the risk of slipping\nWeather Resistant: The surface is covered with a dual-stage textured black powder that can withstand heavy rain and snowstorms; This offers exceptional rust and corrosion resistance\nProfessional installation recommended",
